--- OLD
  @UpDown:
    LDA cursor              ; if up/down, simply toggle the cursor between New Game
    EOR #1                  ;  and continue
    STA cursor
--- NEW
  @UpDown:
    ;  Three rows rather than two, so this is no longer a toggle.  A still
    ;  holds the direction bits, which is what tells up from down.
    JSL opt_titleupdown + OPTFAR
